 inho with FabLab Cuenca\, Spain\, and the Veljko Ramadanovic School\, Serb
 ia)\, which creates sensory cartographies of public spaces\, schools and m
 useums with neurodivergent communities.\n\nOrganisation: Buinho Creative H
 ub (Creative Europe project Invisible Cartographies)\nLocation: Messejana\
 , Alentejo\, Portugal (full-period stay\; work with the Aljustrel school c
 ommunity).\nAward: EUR 1\,200 artist fee for the six weeks\, free accommod
 ation for the full period\, travel budget up to EUR 300\, plus a productio
 n budget and FabLab access. Meals not included. No application fee.\nDurat
 ion: Two funded six-week residencies\, 11 January to 21 February 2027.\n\n
 More: https://www.invisiblecartographies.eu/open-calls?utm_source=artifici
 alnouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=referral
